\newlabel{fig:defense_overview}{{1}{8}{Grouped bar chart of weighted-average accuracy for nine defenses against five attacks. Adaptive-K v2 (blue) leads on four of five attacks. Classical filters (warm colors) fall below the undefended baseline on FGSM. Randomized smoothing (dark red) collapses accuracy.\relax }{figure.caption.5}{}}
